A: 0 hops from A
B: 1 hops from A
C: 1 hops from A
D: 2 hops from A
E: 3 hops from A
F: 3 hops from A
G: 2 hops from A
H: 4 hops from A
I: not reachable from A
J: not reachable from A
A to H: 4 hops via A > C > G > F > H
B to G: 3 hops via B > A > C > G
H to A: 4 hops via H > F > G > C > A
A to J: unreachable
I to J: 1 hops via I > J
